      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5ce5bcba0352b6b63339c959b0ea23d7c8214a4b967d539335d37d0b4fa3654c:000000_-8459677805710193404:g0:r27",
      "row_index_0based": 27,
      "serialized_row_index": 27,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "レイロン",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "なぜこの内容が必要かと言いますと、\n異種間交配における事故防止および、\n快楽効率の最適化を目指しておりまして。",
        "",
        "ch_10367/R18/10367B0_10367_Nml/10367B0_10367_005",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "レイロン",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10367/R18/10367B0_10367_Nml/10367B0_10367_005"
    },
    {
